  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the production of yam cultivation technique thriugh minisett and marketing.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MP3K will work in the Third Communal Section of Camp-Perrin in the Sud department to apply the minisett technique, an inexpensive method of rapid propagation, to the cultivation of three yam varieties. The increase in production and crop sales will boost the income of MP3K&apos;s 1,500 farmers-members and will indirectly benefit the 25,000 other residents of Camp-Perrin. (HA-203)</narrative>
  </description>
